{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-YilCiX57\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-YilCiX57\">什么是轻代码工具？</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-BbDj2mH5\">轻代码工具是一种轻量级的代码工具，帮助代理商/客户通过 直接编写程序代码 或 复用现成代码 的方式搭建一些辅助小工具，解决实际业务中，遇到的通用/定制化的痛点问题</p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-Fln8MIWD\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-Fln8MIWD\">它像什么？</h2><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-d1CAc5bB\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/3a8f009dce344ffab5c26242ace43a94~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016415312&amp;x-signature=xaEc2%2BaaQcBdsXi%2BtFR%2B9BgDz3s%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><h3 id=\"h5957bbf-AUWg8M2F\" data-id=\"h5957bbf-AUWg8M2F\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Excel 的 「宏」</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-hL8CCQ9b\">Excel有一个功能叫做「宏」，电子表格的日常使用中，难免会有一些大批量的机械操作，这些操作会占去编辑者大量的时间</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-b25W0Aaf\">微软提供了一种宏的能力，通过VBA scrpit（一种编程语言），你可以编写直接作用于表格的代码，能实现诸如：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Ia1iEP5I\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2c2HYE5D\">批量编辑内容，校验内容</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4kYY1U8n\">执行数据分析工具，结合函数产出数据结论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TXZfa2bZ\">进行格式化和样式自动化调整；</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dfmb0AkM\">进行计算和公式处理；</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1cZLFmEF\">在多个工作簿/工作表之间自动化地移动数据；</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-Fl43gpsC\">使用Excel宏可以帮助用户大幅简化繁琐的任务，减少输入错误，并节省时间</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-qYacPfrp\"><strong>某种意义上，轻代码工具就是巨量引擎的「宏」</strong></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-8HGFKfNb\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-8HGFKfNb\">他跟API接口的区别是什么？</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"ttcauzd34-2giakedixbms00\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-57agx54jvug000\"><col data-id=\"c8l9xapyo-4wfvpsmo5l4000\" span=\"1\" width=\"16.26848691695108%\"><col data-id=\"c2bcdpdhc-55d3rpbq8kk000\" span=\"1\" width=\"42.77588168373151%\"><col data-id=\"c2dwrz7pc-4l7rnyc74jo000\" span=\"1\" width=\"40.955631399317404%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-8h2zkdviu7g0\"><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1dw8zkhr9qqo00\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-1mi88sz3ilq800\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-36r4fjk30t8000\">区别点</p></td><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-3fccc4zxgvs000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-27krlpurtphc00\"><strong>轻代码工具</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-bt76n3qo8ww00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2dqjecd0nj6s00\"><strong>MAPI 接口</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-4v5osrhwtx2000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-2xbtfw34glk000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5kg3n4fikts000\">产品使用门槛</p></td><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-5ufuea4qpkg000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-cnqprfvfzko00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3jjrfs9usl0000\">只要你有广告账户的访问权限，你可以直接编写/应用代码</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2fvb9132bq4g0\">账户授权机制简化，不需要获取/维护token即可直接调取接口，将研发精力放在业务逻辑的处理中，即使没有API接入经验的研发也可以快速上手</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4qetjwoa0m0000\">提供工具的同时提供了大量可以成功运行的示例代码，帮助客户处理一些复杂逻辑，比如说账户关系拉取</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-2p1b7iafa8a000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-20k84jsj7ubk00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3po8qtfzkm0000\">必须先以公司主体名义注册成为巨量引擎开发者</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1dcndmmkht9c00\">基于Oauth2.0的机制进行整体的授权及鉴权，对于不熟悉该套机制的研发来说，需要花比较多的时间学习和接入，且容易出错导致一些系统问题</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1qt56ojky78g00\">只提供基础的请求示例，较为简单</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-549iu7zolzs000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-tkonqnrbylc00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-451ss1m2z28000\">代码托管方式</p></td><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-164qkrg62nb400\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-3iwd21xjee4000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5n9wqgpiqfg000\">轻代码工具轻代码工具只需要编写代码即可，代码将托管到巨量侧代为运营，无需自行部署服务器</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-4qce28oep2w000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-5rzk8s61p4c000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-p2jy8tb7rfk00\">需要购买独立的服务器及相应资源部署代码</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1e2952x18zls00\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-1qxbna9i5fxc00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-yqdar1w5we800\">平台支持</p></td><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-28hiiglg0ps000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2zuwwozc9oo000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-20r52joaur4w00\">由于代码语言的统一，平台会围绕客户场景诉求，持续供给大量的优秀代码案例供客户直接应用，减少重复造轮子</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1bv0fpr7ya7400\">后续可能会建立社区和市场激励优质功能代码的流通</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-8ctw4ala7tg00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-iy2ol9pjrps00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5bdhh82xexg000\">由于更为底层，开发者所使用的编程语言种类繁杂，更倾向于提供基础的解决方案，不会给到复杂的代码方案</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ap8lx8ng5sw00\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-58c8e6lna2k000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-p2eilhj8bmo00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-kf3syho21c000\">产品能力范围</p></td><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-4uguikukw88000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-395tb3ve43c000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-a2lk8o68gkg00\">主要会重点开放一些核心广告能力，按需迭代</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-10w0mfv5y73k00\">不会局限于广告能力，而是会从客户场景出发提供一些周边串联能力（如 发送消息到飞书群等各种企业IM 的能力）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4agaqcuw4qo000\">目前仅支持 代理商+巨量广告 场景下的开放能力（后续会扩展工作台，巨量千川的场景）</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-3sf8ogu7bfo000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2ypyq65qn9i000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5cifqi5l9f4000\">基本拥有与广告平台等价的API接口能力，会倾向于与平台能力完全对齐</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3rphhgrkijc000\">只会围绕广告核心能力开放</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3fc9qhzfs4o000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-389r46mesiq000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-27g7msu9ussg00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2ge9rta6bgbo00\">解决的问题类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-1lte0hocdj7k00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><blockquote data-id=\"b1ekkn4bk-4lq094h0kui000\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-22y06jnnckjk00\">更聚焦于生产一些可复用的，简单逻辑的代码块，解决具体问题</p></blockquote><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-472tblgfzi0000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4xp8r3vacco000\">碎片化问题：某个独立碎片化的场景，比如说监控一个客户账户的广告数据并推送到报告中</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1jd9aql1a8qo00\">自闭环问题：如余额不足自动转账等场景比较闭合的问题，输入输出信息都仅从媒体侧闭环即可解决的问题</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8nlwikwo-571w1b1w3j0000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><blockquote data-id=\"b1ekkn4bk-4dqd4ztoeho000\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-znq3p5eoixs00\">更聚焦于搭建一个大型系统，涉及到较多模块</p></blockquote><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-3y2s37iq008000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-6e0umd6ub2800\">长链路问题：无法在短时间内获得结论的，需要长周期数据积累分析，或者需要做一系列的加工存储交互才能处理的问题</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1n6p4pnu30qo00\">跨系统问题：解决问题的信息分散在多个系统中，需要在汇总多个系统的信息后才能处理的问题，多输入源，多输出口</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-gvNrlgGQ\">轻代码工具和MAPI接口并不是一个非此即彼的关系，实际开发中可以根据具体情况选择合适的方案，实现事半功倍的效果</p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-XPCVV148\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-XPCVV148\">具体能解决什么问题？</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"ttcauzd34-nd3csxzh5uo00\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-2e9jcjprnhus00\"><col data-id=\"c2dgl1s74-k7nu8qhfy4g00\" span=\"1\" width=\"26.16609783845279%\"><col data-id=\"c2bcdpdhc-2qlx0pdvtdq000\" span=\"1\" width=\"73.83390216154721%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-3jujzky1cfy000\"><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-2phnez9wau8000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14duocf4-465gndi6fa8000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-434ywvis5i0000\"><strong>汇报/分析</strong></p><blockquote data-id=\"b1ekkn4bk-4kp8if0gnxm000\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1h5k7kn7vfhc00\">已支持</p></blockquote></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-5ctolxmdbm8000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-22yrl94xtf0g00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-93faupphhas00\">自动生产日/周报推送到客户群</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-41cuhuhi9r8000\">整合一方数据分析推送到内部群</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3jtkgj8l66k000\">优劣势总结定期复盘</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-38qbgagvboy000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14duocf4-1vyj192tz1uo00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-iqxpp83zj9k00\"><strong>投放提效</strong></p><blockquote data-id=\"b1ekkn4bk-414vbm9v20s000\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-58b8ys1qrc0000\">后续支持</p></blockquote></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-5ag9gxved740\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2ctkl4yxogkk00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-45w70cbanhq000\">批量替换素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-x55x9ibmvg000\">批量处理广告状态</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-yoy85m2in1c0\">低效素材自定义清理</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-2fb5alcd7wlc00\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14duocf4-5mlr5pdfxb4000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2fdnk3o48cnw00\"><strong>自动化调控</strong></p><blockquote data-id=\"b1ekkn4bk-1h04g19l9ts00\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-kqkyfry583k00\">后续支持</p></blockquote></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-3hfn3bk479w000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-24w7jbmincf400\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3tvw9551y02000\">监控广告，做自动启停</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-25v2yhx4qbz400\">动态调节预算</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1agf1aabfrk000\">动态调节出价</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-11u23xdg5xwg00\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t346gfaqe-3bkfhzabhe6000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1oxayskxkq3k00\"><strong>风控/管理</strong></p><blockquote data-id=\"b1ekkn4bk-2se70p5u9a0000\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-26o6isvmhd9c00\">部分支持</p></blockquote></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8nlwikwo-1gteodv73zb400\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-556vsolbkrk000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-15dxbj9ttnmk00\">账户整理检查</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1n4neim7mtpc00\">多账户数据汇总</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-6m5msrlzcwg00\">落地页篡改监控</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-UMP3aJjf\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-UMP3aJjf\">怎么使用？</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-Hu3NKqTS\">为了帮助你更快地理解什么是轻代码工具，我们将为你默认生成了3组实例代码</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"ttcauzd34-8y9ejt1yco400\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-3gwcf1f3vfe000\"><col data-id=\"cue2jcvow-2dw3cy4y2uqs00\" span=\"1\" width=\"36.36363636363637%\"><col data-id=\"cue2jcvow-5c98yuwiwco000\" span=\"1\" width=\"63.63636363636363%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-2mp28yy1mbg000\"><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-15wgpjfytx1c00\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-2wkmkpgnsf0000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3fovy7wvqtq000\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-2xu4wuc72hq000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-19udwoz5z4u800\">解决问题场景</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-4flgem9spua000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-2xpi2u0pi0g000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3y7vi7dp1x8000\">账户余额不足报警（飞书/钉钉/企业微信）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4hod8f76dvs000\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-2efuirr441q800\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3p6jrmu7eby000\">目前账户余额不足后，客户广告消耗投放不出去后，会造成损失，低技术能力的代理目前只能</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2092dgu0slvk00\">但代理并非希望所有账户都监控和处理，有自己的一些差异化策略，故给出一个通用的通知模板，由其微调后，进行通知发送</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-vtj468ziklc00\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-5dx9qwcq4oc000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1r2q49tguzk000\">广告数据日/时报推送（飞书/钉钉/企业微信）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3fcxr8eaxse00\"><br></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-1cm2ency58zk00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2188qw4gxz8g00\">代理本身有大量的对内，对客的报告发送场景，通过一个定制脚本可以实现将需要观测的数据</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3rpy4maglqw000\">一键汇总和发送到客户群或者内部群中，无需人工汇总</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-19ux3f2r31i800\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-dbzka8qehwg00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-u2622w18rpc00\">账户广告过审率低报警（飞书/钉钉/企业微信）</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8nlwikwo-3f57m0fk9g8000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4otbf5t4x3i000\">代理较为关注账户过审情况，通过脚本可以实现定时监控，分析账户整体健康情况，同样推送到内部群聊</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"h6f20189-ND95XmbY\" data-id=\"h6f20189-ND95XmbY\">具体使用方式</h3><h4 id=\"hce1b53f-lbF5nFWc\" data-id=\"hce1b53f-lbF5nFWc\">文字介绍</h4><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-gkH12MgF\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eYv1l19J\">入口</li></ol><ol data-id=\"oacb21b4-KifPNcSW\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RTBuJ5PJ\">登录方舟平台，点击【 导航 - 工具 - 轻代码工具】</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-m6Rcth35\">前往【示例代码】查询需要的脚本</li></ol><ol data-id=\"oa950d4e-f1YYeDEI\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VUVbz1Y1\">找到脚本后，仅需对脚本做以下操作即可快速应用</li></ol><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"ttcauzd34-4qai029cu96000\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-4t774lq4v3m00\"><col data-id=\"cuxe42lhc-2iwrj7elfdw000\" span=\"1\" width=\"24.459613196814562%\"><col data-id=\"c2bcdpdhc-ifs5c4ld2mo0\" span=\"1\" width=\"75.54038680318543%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-ku8dj9kvjxs00\"><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-5bwn0vwenmk000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-508ce42w5lk000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2s7qnhqc8de000\">步骤</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-fynjm5gal2o00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-23cr1px3yszk00\">具体</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-362qvd8bc4c000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-5k12hfg2lz4000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-3sl6b3i1u04000\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-36nprq7l7xk000\">授权</li></ol></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-15byc00rtruk00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2qszmbpsass000\">在新建完成并保存后，点击编辑器的右侧的确认使用进行授权</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-37okb2cwbhu000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-3895iwq7fh4000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-3ek3azklrda000\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1ukgt1zgvuu800\">配置企业IM群机器人</li></ol></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-5l1m3i1n0bs000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><blockquote data-id=\"b1ekkn4bk-5gru8gdz2jc000\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-30x50zixou0000\">机器人的作用是在脚本代码运行成功后通过机器人向群内发送消息</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5itm177i3oc000\">本次三个示例代码都是在某种情况下触发后，可通过机器人发送消息</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-26t778hn0oww00\">以下以飞书为例展开介绍机器人配置过程，钉钉，企业微信的操作整体流程类似，本处略过</p></blockquote><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-466ref4sdwe000\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1xb09k2yo76o00\">在需要的飞书群聊中，找到设置</li></ol><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-4prt8kqugbu000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/5ddfc0e5bf2a414fb3ef518fe1e7ad46~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016417752&amp;x-signature=0CM7RRiB7%2BEhdyBP04A84%2BCoj4w%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-2dkeawnn9vvo00\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5aa7sfhb4q8000\">选择机器人</li></ol><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-lmybhligj4000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/12a78bec7a9b4598ae90690c41129811~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016417759&amp;x-signature=SW7ns%2FPg8sBshlCrNaw2yP1n%2BJ4%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-2yd23hzw6ow000\" start=\"3\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-aceqsruvcrs00\">点击「添加机器人」</li></ol><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-53kucokkadc000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/7af7ac33adfd48649c318467ad76c065~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016416988&amp;x-signature=BY%2FPRkMYdnF8UOixPGVEgV2V2fU%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-21whcy2xcu4g00\" start=\"4\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-31bkqfe927a000\">选择「自定义机器人」</li></ol><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-5kz15ati9wk000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/9db86798b90f48b9ba6b32952c3b3e1d~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016417009&amp;x-signature=3mzVULMh4ypBXzAU7EZflSKcIjs%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-5qyne8qu6so000\" start=\"5\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4p8ftc6fv0o000\">配置机器人信息，此处可以根据自己实际情况修改内容</li></ol><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-4trmu48nl9g000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/dab67030da0c453f96aefab44a8ae7b7~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016417019&amp;x-signature=rb6%2BXPt52YvQSzpiJr0tghaHobA%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-4aqc4wca4ko000\" start=\"6\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1z6s0xct277k00\">完成添加，可以看到生成了一个链接地址，这个地址我们进行复制</li></ol><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-5sphcgsvihc000\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/7d9f027818c34c64a4829820a99064ff~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016417026&amp;x-signature=Kya0IFlOXfvcxyfgKSChlWwCBB0%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-4tmguyjbwcc000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14due3a8-5b9bg9yw4o8000\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-sosd7c57p4w00\" start=\"3\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2adtsylniyas00\">微调代码</li></ol></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-xqg0u1vtaxs00\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-21dsk6hhsl7k00\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3gencialurs000\">点击【脚本-编辑代码】，进入代码器</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4em6v3ho6mq00\">找到webhook_url变量，复制webhook地址，粘贴到代码中的webhook_url变量中</li></ol><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3xii5x8f10o000\">该地址的作用即代码在处理完成后用于接受消息</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2tan5hrobs6000\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">具体教程在每一个示例中都有视频教程，可以查看示例对应教程</span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-10264ramkhhs00\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t58f1wo6w-2sjiq1h55ca000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-18xna3c98yow00\" start=\"4\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-35o5ut392ag000\">命名与配置</li></ol></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du9h6k-19l764pswy8000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"o19a1oojk-ihivhjurydk00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1ud6cg6ao4n400\">为代码命名，然后点击保存</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2eybcwpqaglc00\">点击进行确认，对脚本进行协议确认</li></ol></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t15ucy39c-4rk0i09udmo000\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t14dui5j4-3kvpth6cl02000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"o3i5gzqam-5imupubry3o000\" start=\"5\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1zk5gutboffk00\">运行</li></ol></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t14du65vk-47p0dnonybs000\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"o19a1oojk-2mqczthfpi0000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5j5x8p8x9ng000\">点击左下角的运行或退回首页点击运行，都可以直接运行脚本</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4xc9gj5xnje000\">你可以修改脚本的定时运行规则，以让脚本周期性运行</li></ol></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-WH6eJcb7\" id=\"hce1b53f-MB6Dec5P\">视频介绍（飞书机器人的配置）</h4><div data-type=\"video\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E9%A3%9E%E4%B9%A6%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0.mp4%22%2C%22size%22%3A3284994%2C%22id%22%3A%22ucOFp%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22percent%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Flf3-openapi.byteadverts.com%2Fobj%2Fopen-api-file-public%2Ff8c6aa5a21274f988ecbda40127a0c2e%22%2C%22naturalWidth%22%3A1920%2C%22naturalHeight%22%3A996%2C%22width%22%3A711%2C%22height%22%3A369%7D\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"qz-video-contain\"><video controls=\"\" src=\"https://lf3-openapi.byteadverts.com/obj/open-api-file-public/f8c6aa5a21274f988ecbda40127a0c2e\" webkit-playsinline=\"webkit-playsinline\" playsinline=\"playsinline\" style=\"outline:none;\" widht=\"711\" height=\"369\"></video></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-cAIt3gyK\">想了解脚本的更多基础概念和信息，请阅读<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/openapi/docs?docLibId=1781346820953290&amp;docId=1781346871366857&amp;identifyKey=4c52d27f2feb70dd5cb26002b7f490c9d6e562c6054739a0a30849fefd5460d4\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; paddin